			<CharacterStyleRange AppliedCharacterStyle="CharacterStyle/$ID/[No character style]" FontStyle="Book" AppliedLanguage="$ID/English: UK">
				<Content>The employees of the consolidated entity have the option of joining the Victorian Racing Industry Superannuation Plan (VRISP), which is also available for employees of the Victoria Racing Club and Country Racing Victoria. The fund had a composition of defined benefit and accumulation membership, with the financial information of the fund disclosed in this report relating to those employees of the consolidated entity who were within the defined benefit plan.  </Content>
				<Br />
				<Content>The VRISP defined benefit plan ceased on 29 February 2024, with the accrued benefits of members within this plan transferred to the accumulation section during the period.</Content>
				<Br />
